                <pb facs="0311" n="301" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv07/pg301"/>

                <head>Appendix E to HD–13</head>

                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft of Declaration To Be Signed by
                        the Austrian Plenipotentiaries</hi></p>
                <p>With a view to minimising the losses arising from the sinking of ships and
                    cargoes in the course of the war and to facilitating the recovery of ships and
                    cargoes which can be salved and the adjustment of the private claims arising
                    with regard thereto, the Austrian Government undertake to supply all the
                    information in their power which may be of assistance to the Governments of the
                    Allied and Associated Powers or to their nationals with regard to vessels sunk
                    or damaged by the Austrian naval forces during the period of hostilities.</p>
            </div>
